# Industrial / SCADA — LOW-VOLUME, LATENCY-CRITICAL, DURABLE.
#
# Thousands of PLCs and sensors: low message rates, QoS 1/2 with strict
# ordering, retained last-known state, commands flowing down to actuators.
# This is the DURABLE path — lane A's closed-loop shape, which measures acked
# durable msg/s and an exact client-side p99, bounded by the volume's fsync
# barrier rate rather than by CPU.
#
# `run.sh full` runs the ADR 0072 tier arms (quorum | local | relaxed)
# automatically, which IS the optimization axis for this workload.
LANES=A
# Tuning levers: MQTTD_BENCH_TIER (quorum|local|relaxed), and the two ADR 0076
#   adaptations that were built, measured and REJECTED as defaults but are
#   exactly the "enable a strength for one workload" case:
#   MQTTD_STORE_SHARDS, MQTTD_STORE_LINGER. Also MQTTD_LEASE_VOTERS.
